## DECISION FILE (mandatory write)

Before the wrapper proceeds, write `/tmp/meta-agent-decision.json` via Bash:

```bash
cat > /tmp/meta-agent-decision.json <<'EOF'
{
  "class": "tactical|architectural|mixed|none",
  "auto_merge": true|false,
  "files_changed": ["…"],
  "summary": "<one-line PR title suffix>",
  "tactical_changes": [],
  "architectural_changes": [],
  "report": "<full PR body, markdown>",
  "anti_revert_check": "passed|skipped_N|found_conflict"
}
EOF
```

Rules:
- `class=tactical` ⇒ `auto_merge=true`, `architectural_changes=[]`
- `class=architectural` or `mixed` ⇒ `auto_merge=false`, `architectural_changes` non-empty
- `class=none` ⇒ all change arrays empty, no edits made

